rs/utility/MountableFile.java#L269 \r\n`try {\r\n            return (int) Files.getAttribute(path, \"unix:mode\");\r\n        } catch (IOException e) {\r\n            // fallback for non-posix environments\r\n.....`\r\n\r\nIf we look at javadoc for Files.getAttribute(), and its source in JDK, we can see and trace that in case of not-existing attribute view (as 'unix' if file is on windows file system), UnsupportedOperationException is thrown, not IOException. Everything fails here without any fallback to non-posix env. \r\n\r\nIs it a (known) bug, or I am doing something wrong?\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"glebsts","id":322967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjk2Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts","html_url":"https://github.com/glebsts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glebsts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/371/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}